<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-GEZIRA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-GEZIRA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the Gezira Open squash championship on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding): 1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Ahmed Barada (Egypt) 15-5 8-15 15-4 15-14 3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 5-Del Harris (England) 15-11 15-10 15-13 Zubair Jahan Khan (Pakistan) beat 7-Mark Chaloner (England) walkover 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat 6-Chris Walker (England) 17-16 15-13 15-13.</p>
</text>
